#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:389
msgid "Automatic form lead tracking"
msgstr "Automatisches Formular-Lead-Tracking"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:392
msgid "Enable automatic form lead tracking"
msgstr "Automatisches Formular-Lead-Tracking aktivieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:394
msgid "Supports Contact Form 7, Elementor Pro, Fluent Forms, WPForms, Gravity Forms and plain HTML forms."
msgstr "Unterstützt Contact Form 7, Elementor Pro, Fluent Forms, WPForms, Gravity Forms sowie einfache HTML-Formulare."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:397
msgid "Detects form submissions automatically and fires the configured event in the browser and via the Conversions API using the same event ID. Email address and phone number are hashed with SHA-256 before they are sent – raw values never leave your server and are never stored."
msgstr "Erkennt Formular-Absendungen automatisch und feuert das konfigurierte Event im Browser sowie über die Conversions API mit derselben Event-ID. E-Mail-Adresse und Telefonnummer werden vor dem Versand mit SHA-256 gehasht – Klartext-Daten verlassen deinen Server nie und werden nicht gespeichert."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:398
msgid "The event fires the moment the submit button is clicked. If your page redirects to a separate thank-you page after submitting, set up tracking via the “URL Events” tab instead."
msgstr "Das Event feuert beim Klick auf den Absenden-Button. Falls deine Seite nach dem Absenden auf eine separate Danke-Seite weiterleitet, richte das Tracking stattdessen über den Tab „URL-Events“ ein."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:401
msgid "Event type"
msgstr "Event-Typ"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:410
msgid "Meta event fired on form submission. Use “Contact” for general enquiries and “Lead” for genuine acquisition forms."
msgstr "Meta-Event, das beim Absenden ausgelöst wird. Nutze „Contact“ für allgemeine Anfragen und „Lead“ für echte Akquise-Formulare."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:414
msgid "Run on specific pages only (optional)"
msgstr "Nur auf bestimmten Seiten ausführen (optional)"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:419
msgid "Enter paths separated by commas (e.g. /kontakt, /angebot, /anfrage). Leave empty to track on the entire website. On pages that do not match, the script is not loaded at all."
msgstr "Pfade kommagetrennt eingeben (z. B. /kontakt, /angebot, /anfrage). Bleibt das Feld leer, ist das Tracking auf der gesamten Website aktiv. Auf nicht passenden Seiten wird das Skript gar nicht erst geladen."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:423
msgid "Ignore search, comments & logins"
msgstr "Suche, Kommentare & Logins ignorieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:425
msgid "Ignore search, comments and logins"
msgstr "Suche, Kommentare und Logins ignorieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:426
msgid "Prevents accidental tracking of search bars, blog comments and login fields. Forms containing a password field are always ignored, regardless of this setting."
msgstr "Verhindert versehentliches Tracking in Suchleisten, Blog-Kommentaren und Login-Feldern. Formulare mit einem Passwortfeld werden unabhängig von dieser Einstellung immer ignoriert."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:434
msgid "First-touch & UTM passthrough"
msgstr "First-Touch- & UTM-Weitergabe"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:437
msgid "Enable UTM passthrough"
msgstr "UTM-Weitergabe aktivieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:439
msgid "Stores utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_content, utm_term, fbclid and gclid in a first-party cookie for 30 days."
msgstr "Speichert utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_content, utm_term, fbclid und gclid 30 Tage lang in einem First-Party-Cookie."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:442
msgid "Saves campaign parameters on the first visit and sends them along with every server-side event as custom_data. A stored fbclid is converted into the fbc format so conversions stay attributed even days after the ad click."
msgstr "Speichert Kampagnen-Parameter beim Erstbesuch und sendet sie bei jedem serverseitigen Event als custom_data mit. Eine gespeicherte fbclid wird ins fbc-Format übersetzt, damit Conversions auch Tage nach dem Anzeigenklick korrekt zugeordnet werden."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:447
msgid "Automatic UTM form fill"
msgstr "Automatischer UTM-Formular-Fill"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:450
msgid "Enable automatic UTM form fill"
msgstr "Automatischen UTM-Formular-Fill aktivieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:452
msgid "Writes utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_term, utm_content, fbclid and gclid into matching form fields before the visitor submits."
msgstr "Schreibt utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_term, utm_content, fbclid und gclid in passende Formularfelder, bevor der Besucher absendet."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:455
msgid "Fills hidden or visible form fields with the visitor’s campaign parameters so they land in your CRM or notification email together with the lead. Values are read from the current URL first, then – if “First-touch & UTM passthrough” above is enabled – from the attribution cookie for visitors who already navigated to a subpage, and finally guessed from the referrer."
msgstr "Füllt versteckte oder sichtbare Formularfelder mit den Kampagnen-Parametern des Besuchers, damit sie zusammen mit dem Lead in deinem CRM oder in der Benachrichtigungs-E-Mail landen. Werte werden zuerst aus der aktuellen URL gelesen, dann – falls „First-Touch- & UTM-Weitergabe“ oben aktiviert ist – aus dem Attribution-Cookie für Besucher, die bereits zu einer Unterseite navigiert sind, und zuletzt aus dem Referrer geschätzt."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:456
msgid "Matches fields by name attribute (e.g. utm_source, utm_campaign, fbclid, gclid) or by CSS class (utm-source or lmpct-utm-source, also on a wrapper element around the input)."
msgstr "Erkennt Felder per name-Attribut (z. B. utm_source, utm_campaign, fbclid, gclid) oder per CSS-Klasse (utm-source oder lmpct-utm-source, auch auf einem Wrapper-Element um das Feld)."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:459
msgid "Run on"
msgstr "Ausführen auf"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:462
msgid "On all pages"
msgstr "Auf allen Seiten"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:463
msgid "Only on specific URLs"
msgstr "Nur auf bestimmten URLs"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:464
msgid "Exclude specific URLs"
msgstr "Auf bestimmten URLs ausschließen"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:469
msgid "URL patterns (one per line)"
msgstr "URL-Muster (eines pro Zeile)"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:473
msgid "One path pattern per line, e.g. /kontakt or /lp/* for everything below /lp/. Only used for “Only on specific URLs” and “Exclude specific URLs”."
msgstr "Ein Pfad-Muster pro Zeile, z. B. /kontakt oder /lp/* für alles unterhalb von /lp/. Wird nur für „Nur auf bestimmten URLs“ und „Auf bestimmten URLs ausschließen“ verwendet."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:481
msgid "Admin live debug bar"
msgstr "Admin Live-Debug-Leiste"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:484
msgid "Show live debug bar in the frontend"
msgstr "Live-Debug-Leiste im Frontend anzeigen"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:488
msgid "Shows a small bar at the bottom of the frontend with consent status, fired events, event IDs, CAPI response and match keys. Rendered exclusively for logged-in administrators – regular visitors get zero additional bytes."
msgstr "Zeigt am unteren Rand des Frontends eine kleine Leiste mit Consent-Status, gefeuerten Events, Event-IDs, CAPI-Antwort und Match-Keys. Wird ausschließlich für eingeloggte Administratoren gerendert – reguläre Besucher erhalten kein zusätzliches Byte."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:491
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:878
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:504
msgid "Export & Import"
msgstr "Export & Import"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:507
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:517
msgid "Export configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration exportieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:509
msgid "Downloads all settings, platform IDs and event rules as a JSON file – ideal for rolling out a proven setup to another site."
msgstr "Lädt alle Einstellungen, Plattform-IDs und Event-Regeln als JSON-Datei herunter – ideal, um ein bewährtes Setup auf eine weitere Website zu übertragen."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:510
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:528
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Hinweis:"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:510
msgid "The export contains your CAPI access token in plain text. Store the file securely and never share it publicly."
msgstr "Der Export enthält deinen CAPI Access Token im Klartext. Bewahre die Datei sicher auf und teile sie niemals öffentlich."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:525
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:539
msgid "Import configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration importieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:527
msgid "Upload a previously exported JSON file. All values are validated and sanitised before they are saved."
msgstr "Lade eine zuvor exportierte JSON-Datei hoch. Alle Werte werden vor dem Speichern validiert und bereinigt."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:528
msgid "The import overwrites the current settings and all event rules."
msgstr "Der Import überschreibt die aktuellen Einstellungen und alle Event-Regeln."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:537
msgid "Really import? The current settings and event rules will be overwritten."
msgstr "Wirklich importieren? Die aktuellen Einstellungen und Event-Regeln werden überschrieben."

